===Etymology===
From early modern {{bor|de|nl|frikadel}}, which is borrowed from {{bor|de|fr|fricadel}}, an only later attested variant of {{m|fr|fricandeau}}. A further relation with {{cog|it|frittatella|}} is speculative. Compare contemporary {{cog|nl|frikandel}}.

